Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,You know that feeling when\Nyour goals are scattered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:06.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,across notes, calendars, and\Nhalf-finished lists?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,This brings everything together\Nin one calm workspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:13.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Plan your day. Break big goals\Ninto clear next steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:18.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Check off progress, and keep notes,\Njournal entries, and your diary close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Search across everything instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:23.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,And when you want a\Nbigger-picture view,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:26.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,the Mind section uses\Nyour real activity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:29.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,to help you spot patterns\Nand move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:31.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Less mental clutter.\NMore steady progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:34.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your goals, finally\Nworking with you.
